# The deal window (docs/npc-tools.md) with an AI server (GOTHIC_AI_URL) whose scenario offers a deal
# (`serve --scenario deal_demo --llm off --no-tts`): Xardas offers a thing for 50 gold the hero lacks, then
# for 30, and the hero accepts. The interface is in the frames; the camera at Xardas, from the side.
cheat god
watch nearest
place 200 0
cam face 70 40 1
overlay off
ui on
rec deal
wait 26000
stop
